=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# Note$
# Glyphs mode: Figma's [+] [ ] [*] beside candidates for$
# Partial, Unknown and Not Applicable.$
# The current set is the trial set, which the maintainer$
# adopted: Partial [ ] in status.warn, Unknown [?] and Not$
# Applicable [-] in text.muted, [*] on the risk level alone, the$
# lockout-risk lines pending. The other sets were set aside.$
# Each list is the risk row and Figma's seven rows in all five$
# states.$
# See docs/engine/gallery-glyphs.md.$
$
# glyphs sets --------------------------------------------------$
$
# Power --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [~] Partial              status.warn$
  [?] Unknown              text.muted$
  [-] Not Applicable       text.muted$
$
  [*] Risk Level           Moderate ~ medium security$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, sudo$
  [+] Firewall             Configured deny policy$
  [~] SSH Login            Partial root key-only$
  [ ] SSH Auth             Not Configured password auth on$
  [?] SSH Port             Unknown can't read$
  [-] AppArmor             Not Applicable set by the host$
  [+] Auto Updates         Configured unattended-upgrades$
$
$

